Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:12:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Pokekeep Android F1: el anfitrion de WinForms
 implementa IWinFormsHost

IPokekeepHost pasa a AutoLegalidad.App sin tipos de WinForms (IEditEnvironment). Lo que PKHeX.WinForms
ofrece de verdad (ventana, SaveDataEditor<PictureBox>) se declara ahora en IWinFormsHost (AutoLegalidad.Ui),
que PokekeepApp convierte con WinFormsHostAdapter. Cambio de una linea: sin cambio de comportamiento.
---
 PKHeX.WinForms/Pokekeep/PokekeepIntegration.cs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/PKHeX.WinForms/Pokekeep/PokekeepIntegration.cs b/PKHeX.WinForms/Pokekeep/PokekeepIntegration.cs
index a963ac46d..558932dfd 100644
--- a/PKHeX.WinForms/Pokekeep/PokekeepIntegration.cs
+++ b/PKHeX.WinForms/Pokekeep/PokekeepIntegration.cs
@@ -107,7 +107,7 @@ private static async void Fire(System.Threading.Tasks.Task? task)
         }
     }
 
-    private sealed class MainHost(Main main, SAVEditor sav) : IPokekeepHost
+    private sealed class MainHost(Main main, SAVEditor sav) : IWinFormsHost
     {
         public IWin32Window? Window => main;
         public SaveDataEditor<PictureBox> Env => sav.EditEnv;
